  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Against Bian Si Xuan, Ouyang Bi Sang of Liu tribe’s side activates rank five asura zombie Gu. His teeth lengthen like swords, green hair covers his bald head and body, his blood flow slows, his frame grows thinner, and his eyes become cold green with a jade light.",
        "chapters": [
          526
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bian_si_xuan",
          "char_ouyang_bi_sang",
          "fac_liu_tribe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu belongs to the classic zombie series of transformation path, a line named from rank two roaming zombie Gu through rank three hairy zombie Gu, rank four hopping zombie Gu, and rank five flying zombie Gu. The five great flying zombie Gu are asura zombie, heavenly demon zombie, blood wight, nightmare zombie, and plague zombie. This copy is treated as equally famous as blood wight Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          526
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_roaming_zombie_gu",
          "gu_hairy_zombie_gu",
          "gu_hopping_zombie_gu",
          "gu_blood_wight_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In asura zombie form his defense and recovery rise several fold, pain sense almost vanishes, and Bian Si Xuan’s condensed sword shadow cannot hold him. Hei tribe talk notes that his killer move is asura transformation, with which he had killed a rank five expert, and that in this challenge he has only used asura zombie Gu, not his full strength, yet still drives Shadow Sword Expert back. Later in the same field he does unfold asura transformation: a separate killer move that enlarges him, grows extra arms, and opens a third eye. That move is not this Gu by itself.",
        "chapters": [
          526
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_hei_tribe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the later Imperial Court fighting, Fang Yuan has one rank five asura zombie Gu among new Gu in his aperture, together with rank five earth overlord Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          539
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-aperture",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_imperial_court",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_earth_overlord_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
